1
00:00:00,583 --> 00:00:04,125
Take it... Everything I bear.

2
00:00:06,083 --> 00:00:09,083
Keep on burning.

3
00:00:11,291 --> 00:00:13,750
As long as we are never extinguished...

4
00:00:15,208 --> 00:00:18,541
The Flame-Chase will not end...

5
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:47,541
Do not... Bow your head to THEM...

6
00:01:07,541 --> 00:01:10,083
Take it, Trailblazer.

7
00:01:12,541 --> 00:01:18,041
May this blood be like gold and never tarnish.

